  "@id": "https://biobricks.ai/bricks/cosing-kg",
  "dcterms:title": "cosing-kg - EU CosIng Cosmetic Ingredient Database as RDF knowledge graph",
  "dcterms:description": "The 'cosing-kg' brick transforms the EU CosIng (Cosmetic Ingredient Database) tabular bricks into RDF for the biobricks knowledge graph. Each CosIng ingredient record becomes a node with INCI name, CAS/EC numbers, declared cosmetic function(s) and regulatory annex status, joined to the compound-bridge InChIKey hub. It is derived from three biobricks sources pinned in .bb/dependencies.txt: eu-cosing-ingredients (the 24,094-ingredient table), cosing (the Annex II-VI tables), and pubchem-identifiers-structures (the CAS->InChIKey map). The upstream regulatory data originates from the European Commission's CosIng database under Cosmetics Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009; PubChem provides the identifier mapping.",
  "dcterms:license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
