  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the annotation agent. cosing-kg is a pure RDF transformation of the EU CosIng regulatory data (via the eu-cosing-ingredients and cosing bricks), enriched with the PubChem CAS->InChIKey map. The substantive content is EU Commission CosIng data, reusable under CC BY 4.0 per the Commission legal notice / Decision 2011/833/EU; PubChem identifier data is US-government/public-domain (open) and not more restrictive. The most restrictive component is therefore CC BY 4.0 (attribution), commercial permitted with attribution. HUMAN CHECK: confirm the sibling 'eu-cosing-ingredients' and 'pubchem-identifiers-structures' brick licenses (annotated separately) do not introduce a stricter term; CosIng raw data could arguably be CC0 (open).",
